CO World Heritage Site)</li><li>Experience a spice village tour and learn about world-famous Ceylon spices</li><li>Visit the sacred Temple of the Tooth Relic</li><li>Explore the peaceful Royal Botanical Garden in Kandy</li><li>Optional: Sri Lankan traditional cultural show (time permitting)</li><li>Dinner and overnight stay in Kandy</li></ul>","highlights":[]},{"title":"Day 4: Kandy to Nuwara Eliya - Tea Country and Cool Hills","description":"<ul><li>After breakfast, proceed to Nuwara Eliya</li><li>Optional: Scenic train ride to Nuwara Eliya</li><li>En route near Ramboda, visit Shri Bhakta Hanuman Hindu Temple</li><li>Visit the beautiful Seetha Amman Hindu Kovil</li><li>Take a serene walk through Gregory Park and enjoy sunset by Lake Gregory</li><li>Dinner and overnight stay in Nuwara Eliya</li></ul>","highlights":[{"label":"Scenic Train Ride","image":"/NUWARA ELIYA/Scenic Train Ride.jpg"},{"label":"Tea Experience","image":"/NUWARA ELIYA/Tea Experience.jpg"},{"label":"Horton Plains","image":"/NUWARA ELIYA/Horton Plains.jpg"},{"label":"High Tea Experience","image":"/NUWARA ELIYA/High Tea Experience.jpg"},{"label":"Colonial Architecture","image":"/NUWARA ELIYA/Colonial Architecture.jpg"},{"label":"Seetha Amman Kovil","image":"/NUWARA ELIYA/Seetha Amman Kovil.jpg"}]},{"title":"Day 5: Nuwara Eliya to Bentota - Coastline, Mangroves,","description":"<ul><li>and Turtle Care</li><li>After breakfast, proceed to Bentota</li><li>Enjoy Bentota’s popular water sports (optional): jet ski, banana boat, tube rides,</li><li>diving, snorkeling, deep-sea fishing</li><li>Visit the Kosgoda Turtle Hatchery and learn about sea turtle conservation</li><li>Take an amazing Madu River boat ride through beautiful mangroves</li><li>Stop at a fish farm during the river ride and, if you like, try Sri Lankan fish therapy</li><li>Dinner and overnight stay in Bentota</li></ul>","highlights":[]},{"title":"Day 6: Bentota to Colombo - City Sights, Shopping, and","description":"<ul><li>Seafood</li><li>After breakfast, proceed to Colombo</li><li>Visit Gangaramaya Buddhist Temple and admire its cultural and modern blend</li><li>Walk through the lively Colombo Fort area, including the bazaar, Red Mosque, and</li><li>Dutch Museum</li><li>Continue with shopping at ODEL, Noritake, House of Fashion, Ceylon tea shops,</li><li>handicrafts, and more</li><li>Enjoy mouth-watering seafood at popular seafood restaurants in Colombo</li><li>Overnight stay in Colombo</li></ul>","highlights":[{"label":"Galle Face Green","image":"/COLOMBO/Galle Face Green.webp"},{"label":"Gangaramaya Temple","image":"/COLOMBO/Gangaramaya Temple.jpg"},{"label":"Dutch Hospital","image":"/COLOMBO/Dutch Hospital.jpg"},{"label":"Lotus Tower","image":"/COLOMBO/lotustower.jpg"},{"label":"National Museum","image":"/COLOMBO/National Museum.jpg"},{"label":"Rajamaha Temple","image":"/COLOMBO/Rajamaha Temple.jpg"}]},{"title":"Day 7: Departure - Airport Drop-off","description":"<ul><li>Breakfast at the hotel</li><li>Transfer to the airport for departure (as per flight schedule)</li></ul>","highlights":[]}]$j$::jsonb,
